{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X在S06、S12、S13削弱或改写了几个关键心理动机，尤其是隐秘的孤单、愿意付出而不求回应，以及因害怕失去而想重新藏起喜欢的矛盾，人物心理的因果链不如Y完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X更像真正配合音乐观看的屏幕：关键词突出，感受分层，并按音乐进程出现，观众不必同时消化所有文字，就能抓住叙事重点和声音变化。它的感官描写也更细，有身体感、音乐质感和情绪变化的具体对应。Y胜在心理动机交代得更完整，人物为什么犹豫、为什么反复、为什么最终不再隐藏，前后因果更清楚；但综合边听边扫的实际体验，我选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "90bbc655-b2c3-4633-b7fe-b8372b2138a6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T080135447139Z", "elapsed_seconds": 127.937, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T08:03:43.387687+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5f4fe179895588dbcce932917a00041ea79511b301d9f17ab0b279ac1a58f35b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_